[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.55]
\draw[->] (-7.5,0) -- (4.5,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[->] (0,-5.5) -- (0,2.2) node[above] {$y$};
\foreach \x in {-7,...,-1} {\draw (\x,0.15) -- (\x,-0.15); \node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,-0.15) {$\x$};}
\foreach \x in {1,...,4} {\draw (\x,0.15) -- (\x,-0.15); \node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,-0.15) {$\x$};}
\foreach \y in {-5,...,-1} {\draw (0.15,\y) -- (-0.15,\y); \ifnum\y=-2 \node[right,font=\scriptsize] at (0.25,\y) {$\y$}; \else \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,\y) {$\y$}; \fi}
\foreach \y in {1,2} {\draw (0.15,\y) -- (-0.15,\y); \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,\y) {$\y$};}
\node[above right,font=\scriptsize] at (0,0) {$0$};
\draw[thick,-{Stealth}] plot[domain=0:3.2,samples=101,smooth,variable=\t] ({3-\t*\t},{-4+\t});
\fill (3,-4) circle (3pt);
\fill (2,-3) circle (2pt);
\fill (-1,-2) circle (2pt);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
Which function is shown in the graph?

Which sketch shows $y = \sqrt{x + 5} - 1$ obtained by translating $y = \sqrt{x}$? In each panel, the dashed curve is $y = \sqrt{x}$ and the solid curve is a proposed sketch.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.3,every node/.style={font=\normalsize}]
\foreach \label/\h/\k/\s/\dx/\dy in {A/-5/-1/1/0/0,B/5/-1/1/23/0,C/-5/1/1/0/-14,D/-5/-1/-1/23/-14} {
\begin{scope}[shift={(\dx,\dy)}]
\draw[gray!25,step=1] (-6,-5) grid (14,5);
\draw[->] (-6,0) -- (14.8,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[->] (0,-5) -- (0,5.8) node[above] {$y$};
\foreach \x in {-5,5,10} {\draw (\x,-0.15) -- (\x,0.15); \ifnum\k<0 \ifnum\x=10 \node[below] at (\x,-0.15) {$\x$}; \else \node[above] at (\x,0.15) {$\x$}; \fi \else \node[below] at (\x,-0.15) {$\x$}; \fi}
\foreach \y in {-4,-2,2,4} {\draw (-0.15,\y) -- (0.15,\y); \node[left] at (-0.15,\y) {$\y$};}
\node[below right,xshift=3pt,yshift=-2pt] at (0,0) {$0$};
\node[above right] at (-6,5.5) {\label};
\draw[dashed,thin,-{Stealth}] plot[domain=0:3,samples=101,smooth,variable=\t] ({\t*\t},{\t});
\draw[thick,-{Stealth}] plot[domain=0:3,samples=101,smooth,variable=\t] ({\h+\t*\t},{\k+\s*\t});
\fill (\h,\k) circle (3pt);
\end{scope}
}
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.5]
\draw[->] (-0.5,0) -- (10.5,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[->] (0,-0.5) -- (0,7.5) node[above] {$y$};
\draw[thin,dashed,-{Stealth}] plot[domain=0:3.1,samples=101,smooth,variable=\t] ({\t*\t},{\t});
\node[below right] at (7,2) {$f(x)=\sqrt{x}$};
\draw[thick,-{Stealth}] plot[domain=0:3.1,samples=101,smooth,variable=\t] ({\t*\t},{2*\t});
\node[right] at (5,4.47) {$g(x)$};
\fill (4,4) circle (2pt) node[above left] {$(4,4)$};
